{"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Subscribing","anchor":"Subscribing","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A consumer subscribes when its iterator is created, which is when a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"for try await"},{"type":"text","text":" loop over the subject"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(or over an operator chain built on it) begins. From then on, every value sent is buffered for that consumer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"until it is consumed, so a consumer that is slower than the sender still sees every value, in order."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Values sent while there are no subscribers are discarded; they are never replayed to a later consumer."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Starting a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Task"},{"text":" that iterates the subject does not mean it has subscribed yet. If values must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not be missed, subscribe before starting it: make the iterator now and hand it to the consumer as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncIteratorSequence"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncIteratorSequence(subject.makeAsyncIterator())"},{"text":"). Or wait until the consumer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has subscribed before sending, for example with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handleEvents(receiveMakeIterator:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Important"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancelling a task waiting for the subject’s next value ends that consumer’s subscription; values sent afterwards"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not delivered to it. To read the subject again, make a new iterator."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading"},{"code":["let subject = PassthroughSubject<Int>()","let subscribed = SingleValueSubject<Void>()","","subject.send(0) \/\/ No subscribers yet, so this value is discarded.","","Task {","    for try await value in subject.handleEvents(receiveMakeIterator: { try? subscribed.send() }) {","        print(\"Received value: \\(value)\") \/\/ prints 1, then 2","    }","}","","try await subscribed.execute()","subject.send(1)","subject.send(2)","subject.send(completion: .finished)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Class","externalID":"s:7Afluent18PassthroughSubjectC","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"class","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassthroughSubject"}],"modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"PassthroughSubject.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject.swift#L45"},"title":"PassthroughSubject","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassthroughSubject"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/Sci"],"kind":"relationships"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A subject that broadcasts values to multiple consumers without storing a current value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unlike "},{"code":"CurrentValueSubject","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"PassthroughSubject","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does not retain the most recent value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"text":" that allows multiple tasks to asynchronously consume values and mimics Combine’s PassthroughSubject.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/Iterator"],"anchor":"Structures"},{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/init()"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/makeAsyncIterator()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/makeSubscription()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/send()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/send(_:)","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/send(completion:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"title":"Enumerations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/Completion"],"anchor":"Enumerations"},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/AsyncSequence-Implementations","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/AsyncSequence-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent"]]},"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/afluent","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"Afluent"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/PassthroughSubject/send(completion:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/send(completion:)","abstract":[{"text":"Completes the subject, preventing any further values from being sent.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Current subscribers receive the completion after any values already buffered for them, and consumers that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"start iterating afterwards receive it immediately.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject\/send(completion:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"send","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"completion","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent18PassthroughSubjectC"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">.","kind":"text"},{"text":"Completion","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent18PassthroughSubjectC10CompletionO"},{"text":"<any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Error","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP"},{"text":">)","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"send(completion:)"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/PassthroughSubject":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afl